nch activation otherwise arrived a few pumps after the first window was shown and made the test process frontmost; Show, Activate and BringToFront never make a window key or activate the app - a window is ordered directly above the process's own frontmost window, or to the back when it is the first. A window fully covered by the user's app is reported occluded and Metal vends no drawable, so its frames are drawn into the existing scratch target: every agg draw still runs, only the present is skipped. MacShowInBackgroundTests checks on a real window that it draws while the app stays inactive and the window is not key, and that a second window opens above the first","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"inetsoft-technology/stylebi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:50:40Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e5ebe3b0684ccdc98d3adc1b8db2f411b8ccf406","github_link":"https://github.com/inetsoft-technology/stylebi/commit/e5ebe3b0684ccdc98d3adc1b8db2f411b8ccf406","commit_subject":"Bug #77485, restore the original column order only when the executed SQL was sorted (#6091)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"inetsoft-technology/stylebi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:50:00Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d03e440d67a516c910e1af826762de1b03de8cca","github_link":"https://github.com/inetsoft-technology/stylebi/commit/d03e440d67a516c910e1af826762de1b03de8cca","commit_subject":"Bug #77511, keep a condition's times in its own time zone when the portal shows server time (#6108)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:49:57Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"da4241d3230519c15167a87aa9e2708a7761552c","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/da4241d3230519c15167a87aa9e2708a7761552c","commit_subject":"Fix the build without MongoDB","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:49:57Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"0b113e334f635e1bf35fd3152c91807d2bd1c9d8","github_link":"https: